# Request collection for VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client. curl equivalents are in the README.
@base = http://localhost:8787

### Endpoint index
GET {{base}}/v1

### Full insight report, last 30 days (default)
GET {{base}}/v1/repos/honojs/hono/insights

### Explicit period
GET {{base}}/v1/repos/honojs/hono/insights?since=2026-10-01&until=2026-11-01

### One leaderboard: contributors | reviewers | closers
GET {{base}}/v1/repos/honojs/hono/leaderboards/reviewers?days=90&limit=20

### LLM narrative with hypotheses, confidence and evidence chain (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
GET {{base}}/v1/repos/honojs/hono/narrative?days=30

### Conditional request: paste the ETag from a previous response to get 304 Not Modified
GET {{base}}/v1/repos/honojs/hono/insights
If-None-Match: "paste-etag-here"

### Validation error (problem+json, 400)
GET {{base}}/v1/repos/honojs/hono/insights?since=2026-13-01

### Operations
GET {{base}}/healthz
###
GET {{base}}/readyz
###
GET {{base}}/metrics
